// The asset catalog's app icon. Debug.xcconfig and Release.xcconfig, which include this file,
// fold both axes — release channel and toolchain — into RUNTIME_VIEWER_APP_ICON_NAME; the comment
// there explains them.
//
// Never set ASSETCATALOG_COMPILER_APPICON_NAME on the target in the project file. A target-level
// value outranks this file, so a literal there pins one icon for every channel and every
// toolchain, and nothing reports it until ArchiveScript.sh's icon check fails a beta archive. The
// App Icon field in the target's General tab edits exactly that target-level setting.
ASSETCATALOG_COMPILER_APPICON_NAME = $(RUNTIME_VIEWER_APP_ICON_NAME)
